# The Ford F-150 Raptor R the player drives. Its model is made from the owner's download by
# tools/blender/prepare_raptor.py into target/outback/raptor.glb, and is not kept in the
# repository: it is CC BY-NC-SA, by Ddiaz Design.
name raptor
mesh ../../target/outback/raptor.glb 1
vehicle raptor.vehicle
camera 0 1.7 0
